# Markdown — no autoformatting

Do not run formatters, prettier, markdownlint --fix, or similar on `.md` files.

When editing Markdown:
- Preserve existing line breaks, indentation, and blank lines (especially inside fenced `mermaid` / code blocks).
- Prefer surgical edits (StrReplace) over rewriting whole files.
- Do not "normalize" tables, lists, or diagram syntax for style.
